#   and from app/002's deps hunk (~1564). New sources join :core (not
#   :rearc_bridge) because rearc_bridge/BUILD.gn is app/002's frozen file;
#   fold back at the next pin rebase.
# Platform guards: chrome_content_browser_client.cc compiles on all platforms
#   while the rearc_bridge sources are mac-only, so the include block and the
#   branch are #if BUILDFLAG(IS_MAC)-guarded (~9 LOC with guards vs the plan's
#   ~5 unguarded sketch — recorded as drift).
# Compile-level only: scaffolding seam. Day-one behavior: GetNativeWindow()
#   nil (provider registration is S4's attachment lease); context menus
