# Last rebased: Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca8a) + overlay 001-005.
# Gate evidence: engine/build-p6.log exit 0 (attempt 4; attempts 1-3 fixed
#   header drift: native_ui_types.h, drop_data.h, base/functional/callback.h).
